<area shape="poly" id="edge94" href="https://www.row2k.com/results/resultspage.cfm?UID=14668C4F76D76786763E8999C0590073&amp;cat=5" title="NEIRA Boys &amp; Girls Fours,Brooks vs.Groton, BHS , NCDS			
Distance: 1500m Conditions: Good racing conditions &#45; occasional rain and quartering headwind/ headwind varying from 6&#45;8 mph. Race order was G1,B3,G3,B4,G4,B2,G2,B1 Comments: Due to equipment breakage in the Brooks B1 during warmup, Boys first boat was moved to the end of the racing order &#45; thank you to our competitors&#39; flexibility. Groton G1 experienced some rigging problems during their race. 
Overall a good day of racing on Lake Cochichewick after a very windy week. Good luck to all crews for the remainder of your seasons. A special thanks to the NCDS coaching team for your help out on the water today.
