Distance: 1500m Conditions: Tail current, light headwind and chop. Headwind and chop moderate for later GV2, BV3/4 and novice races. Comments: BV3/4 and novice boys/girls races restarted in place 10 and 20 strokes in, respectively, due to collisions. Combined Boys V3 and V4 races, and Novice Boys and Girls races.
Except for the V1 races, many varsity boats contained novice rowers due to illnesses/student regatta conflicts.
